    {
      "id": "a-shifting-perspective",
      "title": "A shifting perspective",
      "anchor": "A_shifting_perspective",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "You will take increasing amounts of bleed damage while in the tombs. If you die, you will spawn in the centre of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Menaphos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Menaphos</a> and must re-enter the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Golden_Palace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Golden Palace</a> to try again. Your progress will not be saved. It is not known if this death is safe for <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hardcore_Ironman_Mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hardcore Ironman Mode</a> players. You can regenerate <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Life_points\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">life points</a> inside with the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Persistent_Rage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Persistent Rage</a> relic power."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "It is possible to generate a Shifting Tomb without all resources present (e.g. chests or sarcophagi). If you do, you have to lobby and restart."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "a-shifting-perspective:190nhvx",
          "html": "Attempt to exit the shifting tomb via the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rope_(Pharaoh%27s_Folly)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">rope</a>.",
          "text": "Attempt to exit the shifting tomb via the rope.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "a-shifting-perspective:vq8pha",
          "html": "Search the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Arrow_shafts_(Pharaoh%27s_Folly)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">arrow shafts</a> to receive a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mysterious_message\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mysterious message</a> and a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Spare_arrow_shaft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">spare arrow shaft</a>.",
          "text": "Search the arrow shafts to receive a mysterious message and a spare arrow shaft.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "a-shifting-perspective:15r5ecv",
          "html": "Read the mysterious message.",
          "text": "Read the mysterious message.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "a-shifting-perspective:1b103dg",
          "html": "Speak to the four cats (indicated by yellow dots on your minimap) to receive a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Curved_bone_(Pharaoh%27s_Folly)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">curved bone</a>:",
          "text": "Speak to the four cats (indicated by yellow dots on your minimap) to receive a curved bone:",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "a-shifting-perspective:1b103dg:kgy7s9",
